00:08:40,000 --> 00:08:46,000
My Own Private Idaho is a drama film directed by Gus Van Sant.

3
00:13:00,000 --> 00:13:06,000
In this loose adaptation of Shakespeare's "Henry IV," Mike
Waters is a hustler afflicted with narcolepsy.

4
00:17:20,000 --> 00:17:26,000
Scott Favor is the rebellious son of a mayor.

5
00:21:40,000 --> 00:21:46,000
Together, the two travel from Portland, Oregon to Idaho and finally to the
coast of Italy in a quest to find Mike's estranged mother.

6
00:26:00,000 --> 00:26:06,000
Along the way they turn tricks for money and drugs, eventually attracting
the attention of a wealthy benefactor and sexual deviant.

7
00:30:20,000 --> 00:30:26,000
Mike Waters, played by River Phoenix.

8
00:34:40,000 --> 00:34:46,000
Scott Favor, played by Keanu Reeves.

